@startuml
title Tahapan Model ResNet18 (Latest)

start
:Mulai;
:Input Dataset Sungai;

:Preprocessing
- Resize 224x224
- Normalisasi [0,1];

:Split Data 70/15/15
(Train / Val / Test);

if (Augmentasi digunakan?) then (Ya)
  :Augmentasi (opsional);
else (Tidak)
  :Skip augmentasi;
endif

:Save data_processed_original_only
(train/val/test .npy + metadata);

:Load data .npy (train/val/test);
:Normalisasi ImageNet (mean/std);
:Konversi ke tensor PyTorch;
:Create DataLoader;

:Build ResNet18
- Pretrained ImageNet
- FC head: 512 -> 256 -> ReLU -> Dropout 0.5 -> 2;

:Training Progressive Freeze (2 stage)
Stage 1: FC only, lr_fc
Stage 2: layer4 + FC, lr_layer4 + lr_fc
+ early stopping per stage
+ ReduceLROnPlateau;

:Save best model + metadata;

:Evaluation (test set)
- Load model
- Normalisasi ImageNet
- Prediksi
- Metrics: accuracy, precision, recall, F1, ROC-AUC
- Confusion matrix + ROC curve
- Save evaluation_results.json;

:Hasil Klasifikasi;
stop

@enduml